graph TD
    Exception["Runtime Failure / Tool Exception Caught"] --> ErrorDetector["ErrorDetector: Normalize & Redact Stack Trace"]
    ErrorDetector --> ErrorClassifier["ErrorClassifier: Classify into Error Category\n- DATA_TYPE_CONFLICT\n- CONVERGENCE_FAILURE\n- OUT_OF_MEMORY\n- LEAKAGE_DETECTED\n- CORRUPTED_VALUES"]
    
    ErrorClassifier --> RootCause["RootCauseAgent: Diagnose Specific Conflict\n(e.g., KNNImputer used on string category)"]
    RootCause --> CircuitBreaker{"CircuitBreaker & RetryManager Check:\nHas retry limit been reached?"}

    CircuitBreaker -->|Retries Remaining & Under Threshold| RecoveryPlanner["RecoveryPlannerAgent: Formulate Alternative Strategy"]
    RecoveryPlanner --> RecoveryExecutor["RecoveryExecutor: Apply Pipeline Transformation Repair\n- Switch to SimpleImputer(strategy='most_frequent')\n- Drop high-cardinality/leaking column\n- Downscale model complexity / batch size"]
    RecoveryExecutor --> RetryStep["Re-execute Failed Stage"]

    CircuitBreaker -->|Threshold Exceeded / Critical Error| SafeFallback["FallbackSupervisorAgent: Safe Fallback State"]
    SafeFallback --> Rollback["RollbackManager: Restore from Checkpoint Snapshot"]
    Rollback --> UserEscalation["Escalate to User with Clear Diagnostic Rationale & Guidance"]
